### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Encrypt Data - Example 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encrypt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plainText": "Hello from VSCode! This is my secret message."
}

### Decrypt Data - Replace {id} with actual ID from encrypt response
GET http://localhost:8080/api/decrypt/8

### Encrypt Data - Example 2 (Unicode)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encrypt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plainText": "Unicode test: 世界 🌍 Привет مرحبا"
}

### Encrypt Data - Example 3 (Special Characters)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encrypt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plainText": "Special chars: !@#$%^&*()_+-={}[]|\\:;\"'<>,.?/~`"
}

### Encrypt Data - Example 4 (Large Text)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encrypt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plainText": "This is a longer message that contains sensitive information like credit card numbers, social security numbers, or other PII that needs to be encrypted and stored securely in the database."
}

### Test Error Handling - Empty String (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/encrypt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plainText": ""
}

### Test Error Handling - Non-existent ID (should fail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/decrypt/999999
